    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Relaxing Farm: Merge Tales</i> is a cozy, card-based farming and merging game where you build your dream farm one card at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Drag, Merge, and Grow</strong><br>Plant seeds, raise animals, and combine ingredients by simply dragging and stacking cards. Watch your farm expand as you create everything from wheat and eggs to cheese, hotpots, and honey roast duck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Farm, Sell, and Profit</strong><br>Harvest fresh produce, sell it at the market for coins, or merge it into high-value products to maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Order-Driven Gameplay</strong><br>Complete customer orders to earn rewards, unlock new crops, animals, and processing buildings, and grow your farm from a humble patch into a bustling business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Order Waves &amp; Time-Limited Challenges</strong><br>Take on exciting \u201cOrder Waves,\u201d where you\u2019ll race to fulfill multiple orders within a time limit\u2014testing your strategy and keeping you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Relaxing Yet Rewarding</strong><br>Whether you're casually farming or optimizing your production chain, every merge and every coin feels satisfying. With a charming art style and easy-to-learn mechanics, <i>Relaxing Farm: Merge Tales</i> is the perfect game to unwind and feel accomplished.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Relaxing Farm: Merge Tales</i> is a cozy, card-based farming and merging game where you build your dream farm one card at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Drag, Merge, and Grow</strong><br>Plant seeds, raise animals, and combine ingredients by simply dragging and stacking cards. Watch your farm expand as you create everything from wheat and eggs to cheese, hotpots, and honey roast duck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Farm, Sell, and Profit</strong><br>Harvest fresh produce, sell it at the market for coins, or merge it into high-value products to maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Order-Driven Gameplay</strong><br>Complete customer orders to earn rewards, unlock new crops, animals, and processing buildings, and grow your farm from a humble patch into a bustling business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Order Waves &amp; Time-Limited Challenges</strong><br>Take on exciting \u201cOrder Waves,\u201d where you\u2019ll race to fulfill multiple orders within a time limit\u2014testing your strategy and keeping you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Relaxing Yet Rewarding</strong><br>Whether you're casually farming or optimizing your production chain, every merge and every coin feels satisfying. With a charming art style and easy-to-learn mechanics, <i>Relaxing Farm: Merge Tales</i> is the perfect game to unwind and feel accomplished.</p>",
    "short_description": "A cozy card-merging farm game. Drag, stack, and combine crops, animals, and recipes to grow your farm, fulfill orders, and build a thriving countryside business.",
